        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Cu fraction, mechanical treatment, shredder mat. of manual dismantling, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Cu fraction, mechanical treatment, shredder mat. of manual dismantling, at plant
shredding/separation procedure, based on common transfer coefficients. Data from literature and from own experiences in Switzerland.;
UUID: 78a1f9ff-dac6-44c8-bb51-5376183d2046
This dataset represents the mechanical treatment (shredder) of material from manual dismantling that cannot be further dismantled manually.
Location: European data, used as average for global situation
Technology: 4-step-procedure (shredder - separation - shredder - separation) as used currently often in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and own experiences 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_78a1f9ff-dac6-44c8-bb51-5376183d2046.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
